  "body": "## Description\r\nThis PR adds a board-wide \"open all apps in new tabs\" action button to the board content header, allowing users to open every app on the current board layout in new tabs with a single click \u2014 rather than having to go into each category individually.\r\n\r\nCloses #3771 \r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- **New board header button** (\\`_header-actions.tsx\\`): Adds an external-link icon button that collects all app IDs on the current layout and opens them in new tabs. Visible for both editors (in view mode) and read-only users.\r\n- **Shared helper** (\\`open-apps-in-new-tabs.ts\\`): Extracted \\`openAppsInNewTabs(appIds, { t, openConfirmModal })\\` so the board-level and category-level actions share the same logic. Tests included.\r\n- **Category action** (\\`category-menu-actions.tsx\\`): Now uses the shared helper (also picks up dedup + security fixes for free).\r\n- **Documentation** (\\`after-the-installation.mdx\\`): Added a note about the board-level open all action.\r\n\r\n## Implementation details\r\n\r\n- App IDs are de-duplicated before fetching to avoid duplicate tabs and redundant network/DB work.\r\n- Tabs are opened with \\`noopener,noreferrer\\` to prevent reverse tabnabbing.\r\n- Popup-blocked tabs trigger the existing confirm modal.\r\n\r\n## Checklist\r\n\r\n- [x] Builds without warnings or errors (\\`pnpm build\\`)\r\n- [x] Formatted with \\`pnpm format:fix\\`\r\n- [x] Pull request targets \\`dev\\` branch\r\n- [x] Commits follow the [conventional commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/en/v1.0.0/) guideline\r\n- [x] No shorthand variable names\r\n- [x] Documentation is up to date\r\n\r\n# Screenshot\r\n<img width=\"572\" height=\"258\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/da82dd0a-abb2-4aa5-893f-3af07a8754c2\" />\r\n<img width=\"590\" height=\"259\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4cbfe1e0-9f8c-41e7-a982-8f1121cb1fca\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added an \u201copen all in new tabs\u201d action from board headers and category menus to launch multiple apps at once.\n  * Allows opening apps for the current board layout in new tabs.\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * De-duplicates apps and improves handling when browsers block pop-ups, including a clearer confirmation flow.\n* **Documentation**\n  * Updated the \u201cUsing categories\u201d instructions to reflect the new tab-opening actions.\n* **Tests**\n  * Added coverage for opening multiple apps in new tabs.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
